OL,4,V ||||||||||||||||||
OL,5,F
OL,6, The basic rate of income tax is to be
OL,7, reduced by 2p to 27 per cent, Mr Nigel
OL,8, Lawson has announced.
OL,10,FHe said the reduction would be worth
OL,11,Fmore than #3 a week to a man on average
OL,12,Fearnings.
OL,14,FHe proposed a corresponding cut in the
OL,15,Fsmall companies' rate of Corporation
OL,16,FTax from 29 per cent to 27 per cent.
OL,18,FHe said the income tax changes would
OL,19,Ftake affect on the first pay day after
OL,20,FMay 17 and would cost a little more
OL,21,Fthan #2 billion in 1987-88.
OL,23,D]CFromF17-03-87C/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
