OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1773705835
OL,1,T]St000p4p0p0t  <4,4V]D            A3/6
OL,2,T]S555555u5=%5  75 5V]DNEWS FROM
OL,3,T]S#!#!#!,%#!#  #! !V]DBBC CEEFAX
OL,4,V ||||||||||||||||||
OL,5,F
OL,6, The Chancellor said he was raising all
OL,7, main tax thresholds by about 3.7%.
OL,9,S/FSingle person's allowance will rise
OL,10,Fby #90 to #2,425 and the married man's
OL,11,Fallowance by #140 to #3,795.
OL,13,S/FSingle age allowance will rise by
OL,14,F#110 to #2,960.
OL,16,S/FMarried age allowance up by #170 to
OL,17,F#4,675.
OL,19,S/FThreshold for 45% rate up by #200 to
OL,20,F#20,400.
OL,22,S/FHigher tax thresholds stay unchanged.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,190,120,250,0,100
PN,18104
SC,0004
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1773705835
OL,1,T]St000p4p0p0t  <4,4V]D            A4/6
OL,2,T]S555555u5=%5  75 5V]DNEWS FROM
OL,3,T]S#!#!#!,%#!#  #! !V]DBBC CEEFAX
OL,4,V ||||||||||||||||||
OL,5,F
OL,6, Mr Lawson also announced an increase
OL,7, in the age allowance for the over-80s.
OL,9,FHe said the increase would be double
OL,10,Fthe statutory indexation.
OL,12,S/FSingle age allowance for the over-80s
OL,13,Fup #220 to #3,070.
OL,15,S/FMarried age allowance for over-80s up
OL,16,F#340 to #4,845.
OL,18,FMr Lawson said this would benefit about
OL,19,F400,000 taxpayers with 25,000 of them
OL,20,Fbeing taken out of the income tax
OL,21,Fsystem altogether.
OL,23,D]CFromF17-03-87C/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,190,120,250,0,100
